<title>USA: Bull &amp; Bear U.S. Government sets qtly div.</title>
<headline>Bull &amp; Bear U.S. Government sets qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bull &amp; Bear U.S. Government Securities Fund Inc said it declared a quarterly dividend of $0.19 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on June 30 to shareholders of record on June 16.</p>
<p>The prior dividend paid was $0.18 per share paid on March 31.</p>
<p>The company said it does not pay a regular amount for its quarterly dividend.</p>
